1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:01,699
Karang sekarat ini...

2
00:00:01,699 --> 00:00:03,845
hidup lagi karena satu sentuhan.

3
00:00:03,845 --> 00:00:05,233
Dan penemuannya...

4
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:06,110
tidak sengaja.

5
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,068
Kepanasan,

6
00:00:07,068 --> 00:00:09,443
karang mengusir alga sumber makanannya...

7
00:00:09,443 --> 00:00:10,082
memutih,

8
00:00:10,082 --> 00:00:11,059
lalu kelaparan.

9
00:00:11,059 --> 00:00:12,018
Di lab Stanford,

10
00:00:12,018 --> 00:00:13,041
karang sehat...

11
00:00:13,041 --> 00:00:14,694
menimpa kembarannya yang memutih.

12
00:00:14,694 --> 00:00:16,037
Di titik sentuhan...

13
00:00:16,037 --> 00:00:17,014
warnanya kembali!

14
00:00:17,014 --> 00:00:17,680
Diuji:

15
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,854
yang bersentuhan pulih dalam 7 minggu!

16
00:00:19,854 --> 00:00:22,046
Yang dipisah beberapa milimeter...

17
00:00:22,046 --> 00:00:22,521
mati.

18
00:00:22,521 --> 00:00:24,274
Tapi harus kembaran sendiri...

19
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:25,580
karang asing saling menolak,

20
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,087
seperti transplantasi organ!

21
00:00:27,087 --> 00:00:29,970
Kirim ke saudaramu yang selalu menolongmu!
